# Tripo source for the launch switch: 64 MB, and the build does not read it.
# scripts/build-joystick.mjs derives web/public/models/joystick-{base,lever}.glb
# from it, and those compressed parts (1.97 MB total) are committed. Keeping a
# 64 MB blob in history is effectively permanent — add it via Git LFS if the
# original needs to be tracked.
futuristic joystick 3d model.glb
